# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Skinning 250-275
section Skinning 250-275

step Beasts 44-49 (250-275)
  tip Walk the loop and kill and skin Primitive Owlbeast (44), Savage Owlbeast (46), Silvermane Stalker (47), Ravasaur (48), Ravasaur Hunter (49), Ravasaur Runner (49), Saltwater Snapjaw (49) until Skinning 275; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points: about 20 Thick Leather and 10 Rugged Leather. For Leatherworking: about 375 Thick Leather and 1030 Rugged Leather in all.
