# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Skinning 275-300
section Skinning 275-300

step Beasts 53-55 (275-300)
  tip Walk the loop and kill and skin Diseased Wolf (53), Ragged Owlbeast (53), Shardtooth Bear (53), Stonelash Scorpid (54), Diseased Grizzly (55) until Skinning 300; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points: about 15 Rugged Leather, 10 Thick Leather and 5 Heavy Scorpid Scale. For Leatherworking: about 1030 Rugged Leather and 375 Thick Leather in all.
